+        // ADMA pacing (PS2X_IOP_ADMA_PACE, default on; =0 reverts): when the core is in AutoDMA
+        // mode (ADMAS at core+0x1B0 nonzero) the SPU2 consumes one 32-bit word (one stereo
+        // 16-bit sample) per 48 kHz tick = 768 IOP cycles. Without this, completion fires
